<title>GREECE: BASKETBALL-PANATHINAIKOS BEAT SEVILLA 90-71 IN EUROLEAGUE.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-PANATHINAIKOS BEAT SEVILLA 90-71 IN EUROLEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Panathinaikos (Greece) beat</p>
<p>Sevilla (Spain) 90-71 (halftime 52-32) in a men's EuroLeague</p>
<p>group G basketball match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Panathinaikos - John Amaechi 19, Byron Dinkins 18, Nikos</p>
<p>Economou 18</p>
<p>Sevilla - Benito Doblado 19, Michael Anderson 18, Tellis</p>
<p>Frank 13</p>
</text>
